{title: Tu Hi Meri Shab Hai}
{artist: K K Pritam Gangster}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]tu hi meri shab [Em]hai,        subha hai [Am]tu hi din hai [F]mera
[Am]tu hi mera rab [Em]hai,        jahaan hai [Am]tu hi meri duni [F]ya
[Am]tu waqt mere li [G]ye,        [F]main hoon tera lam [Am]ha
[Am]kaise rahega bha [G]la,        [F]hoke tu mujhse ju [Am]daa
o o o o [G]ho ho o o o o [Am]ho ho,        [Am]aankhon se [Em]padhke tujhe
[G]dil pe mai [Am]ne likha,        [Am]tu ban ga [Em]ya hai mere
[G]jeene ki [Am]ek wajah,        repeat
[Am]teri ha [D]si, [C]teri a [D]daa,        [Em]auron se [G]hai [F]bilkul ju [Am]daa
o o o o [G]ho ho o o o o [Am]ho ho,        [Am]aankhen te [Em]ri shabnami
[G]chehra te [Am]ra aaina,        [Am]tu hai u [Em]daasi bhari
[G]koi ha [Am]seen dastaan,        repeat
[Am]dil mein hai [D]kya [C]kuchh toh ba [D]ta,        [Em]kyon hai bha [G]la [F]khud se kha [Am]fa
o o o o [G]ho ho o o o o [Am]ho ho
